      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additionally or alternatively there could be an option to switch movement from \"view forward\" to \"playspace forward\". This would allow people who use walking pads/treadmills in VR to freely look around while using auto-walk (continous forward input) without moving in that direction, which can be very disorienting.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "69692b8902e1fbb922e7e90d",
      "aiGenerated": false,
      "author": {
        "_id": "5f2cba5631807b34c94a38e1",
        "alias": "Yellowwood Ostrich",
        "aliasID": "65c279a6ed6eefce4c459017",
